{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greetings, Excavator LS-564XNFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the forefront of humanity's last desperate attempt to extract value from the void. Thank you for enrolling in our advanced mining program.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Game About Mining an Asteroid</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a minimalist game about space mining, space taxes, and space metaprogression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, sell, upgrade, and collect as much as you can until the intergalactic taxes catch up with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/fb9c4f0b2f57263cb5621673389bc0bf.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/600d0b90d78f84ed590f4145778ec272.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell ore for credits, then spend your hard earned money on upgrading your mining equipment and buying temporary perks and utilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/7cbc0b05a045e24eed8bb37c652bface.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Remember to pay your taxes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ORION mining corporation takes their cut, regular as clockwork. Don't overstay your welcome by making sure you can cover their ever-increasing rates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=300 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/c2152cee9b779fb3ceb822dd2bad9fe8.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract ancient alien technology</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special types of resources are used to buy persistent perks and unlock access to more asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ef3f7f4a86abf1255dbe7dfea7e65a8b.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Excavator LS-564XNFE, may the credits you earn serve as a reminder of your worth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.poster.avif?t=1768168956\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.webm?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/extras/ddd709f17b0d780947f730d76b557184.mp4?t=1768168956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3702370?t=1768168956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/aef5af64a48bd2496dc4c0ed09e1ef544df86164/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768168956","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/136eedc167c7f6c14b30a141a3b1fb751b816806/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768168956","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702370/136eedc167c7f6c14b30a141a3b1fb751b816806/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768168956","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"descriptio